{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgtdsl1abm","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Multi-repo audit: loop and reads are per-repo, but self-healing sweeps, /state agents, and /ready are still single-workspace","summary":"Audit (2026-06-16) of daemon workspace handling for multi-repo correctness, following the per-repo dashboard (task #1). PER-REPO ALREADY (correct): the heartbeat loop — decideAll builds a per-loop-workspace ctx via ctxFor(L.workspace) (daemon.js:1148) so spawn + ready-task selection + the judge/eager drain run against each loop's own overlay; stale-CLAIM release rides buildGraph(ws) (daemon.js:1637); read endpoints honor ?workspace= (/state, /search, /learnings, /graph/delta, /costflow, /task/detail, /guidance); MCP read tools + claim-release honor session workspace (prior read-side-gremlin fix); caches keyed per-ws; learner drain per-repo by --repo invocation. STILL SINGLE-WORKSPACE (gaps): (1 HIGH) the self-healing sweeps in decideAll — sweepStaleVerdicts() (daemon.js:644/1137), sweepStaleGuidance() (691/1138), sweepFailedTasks() (601/1139) — run only on state.overlay/state.workspace, so a non-current repo running a loop never re-dispatches stale tested/ready hand-offs, auto-resolves stale blocking guidance, or auto-retries failed tasks; fix = sweep once per distinct active-loop workspace (reuse ctxFor's set). (2 MED) /state returns a GLOBAL agents list (routes/meta.js:179 agentsArr()) regardless of ?workspace=, so the per-repo dashboard's worker panel shows all repos' agents; filter by a.workspace===ws; /agents (routes/exec.js:206) likewise needs ?workspace=. (3 MED) /ready (routes/meta.js:123) uses buildGraph(state.workspace) with no ?workspace=. (4 LOW) periodic timer sweeps (daemon.js:2202-2209) default to state.workspace; sweepStaleLoops reads current-ws config thresholds for all loops. (5 LOW) SSE /events is an untagged global broadcast (every dashboard refetches on any repo's mutation; harmless). (6 NICE) show_dashboard (lib/mcp-core.js:178) renders a fixed UI URI, not deep-linked to the session's workspace. sweepOrphanNotes is a disabled no-op (daemon.js:1484). Throughline: reads + loop are per-repo; the maintenance/observability layer still assumes one wo","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T15:46:02.101Z","vec":[-0.0727464035153389,-0.0500033013522625,-0.05398842319846153,-0.005394156090915203,0.037353597581386566,-0.09021846204996109,0.024242885410785675,-0.062834732234478,0.04324576258659363,0.03884373605251312,-0.0009091169340535998,-0.007470187731087208,-0.011987428180873394,-0.016724949702620506,-0.052164461463689804,-0.006048079114407301,0.014022707007825375,0.0007436294108629227,-0.0033930502831935883,-0.05579349026083946,0.06527881324291229,-0.023233965039253235,0.011470618657767773,-0.012671271339058876,-0.058706749230623245,0.043188922107219696,-0.11508407443761826,-0.04320639744400978,-0.061452824622392654,-0.06798625737428665,0.02943231537938118,-0.008529486134648323,-0.0745050460100174,-0.013530504889786243,0.050305724143981934,0.1061725988984108,-0.02999033033847809,0.012535528279840946,-0.04756200313568115,-0.0007799353334121406,0.019125325605273247,0.1104932650923729,-0.016298217698931694,0.007032659370452166,-0.0035928478464484215,-0.0761822983622551,-0.0949547216296196,-0.09201740473508835,-0.04033510386943817,-0.03643898293375969,-0.038636498153209686,-0.02155410684645176,0.029804274439811707,0.02760033868253231,0.051832616329193115,0.062053363770246506,0.051872603595256805,0.05337857827544212,-0.022432828322052956,-0.05934525281190872,0.0586986169219017,-0.034880131483078,-0.02788994275033474,-0.008558995090425014,0.006632185075432062,0.035048529505729675,-0.0031292543280869722,0.008138382807374,0.035832107067108154,-0.048293452709913254,-0.04364613816142082,0.053626902401447296,-0.02972036600112915,-0.056874748319387436,-0.007209977135062218,0.05701484531164169,0.02590269036591053,-0.002118933480232954,0.012333652935922146,-0.15008459985256195,-0.06186525151133537,0.038389